-Cancellation is not implemented. When added, cancellation less than 24 hours
-before the start receives no refund; at least 24 hours before receives a full
-refund.
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking and returns `{ bookingId, refund }` in
+integer euro cents. Cancellation less than 24 hours before the start (including
+at or after the start) receives no refund; at least 24 hours before receives the
+full amount paid, including any discount. `at` is an ISO-8601 UTC string with `Z`
+or `+00:00`, allowing minutes, seconds, and up to three fractional second digits.
+Cancelled bookings immediately release their equipment for availability and new
+bookings. Unknown booking IDs, repeat cancellations, and invalid cancellation
+times are rejected without changing any reservation.
 
 Run `npm test` with Node.js 22.18 or later (native TypeScript type stripping).
